---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import NewsletterSection from "../../components/NewsletterSection.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Motiva Hub" description="A sanctuary for the disciplined mind. Motiva Hub exists to help people build a stronger mindset, better habits and consistent daily progress.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker" data-i18n="aboutKicker">About Motiva Hub</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="aboutTitle">A sanctuary for the <em>disciplined mind.</em></h1>
      <p data-i18n="aboutSubtitle">Motiva Hub exists to help people build a stronger mindset, better habits and consistent daily progress.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feed">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-body">
        <h2>Our Intent</h2>
        <p>Motiva Hub exists for the person who has grown tired of being inspired and is ready to be changed. We treat personal growth as a discipline, not a mood — the slow, unglamorous work of becoming someone worth being.</p>
        <p>We are an independent editorial project, built in the spirit of the great print magazines — quiet, deliberate, and allergic to noise. Our subjects are old ones: mindset, habit, discipline, attention, growth. They have guided disciplined minds for two thousand years; we simply translate them for the modern reader.</p>
        <h2>About the Author</h2>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin:24px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <div style="width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;border:2px solid #c8a04a;">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="80" height="80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="abGold" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fff3c4"/>
                  <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#e8c879"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8a6420"/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <g transform="translate(40, 44)" text-anchor="middle">
                <path d="M -16 -16 L -13 -16 L -7 -3 L -1 -16 L 2 -16 L -6 0 L -6 16 L -9 16 L -9 0 Z" fill="url(#abGold)" stroke="#5a3e10" stroke-width="0.3"/>
                <path d="M 6 -16 L 6 16 L 9 16 L 9 3 L 14 3 L 19 16 L 22 16 L 16 2 Q 20 2 20 -4 Q 20 -16 10 -16 Z M 9 -13 L 10 -13 Q 17 -13 17 -4 Q 17 0 10 0 L 9 0 Z" fill="url(#abGold)" stroke="#5a3e10" stroke-width="0.3"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p style="margin:0;flex:1;min-width:240px;"><strong>Youssef Raihane</strong> — writer and practitioner of the disciplines we explore. I write from lived practice, testing each idea in the daily work of building a stronger mind, not just from books.</p>
        </div>
        <h2>Seven Principles</h2>
        <div class="pillars" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));">
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Stillness</p>
            <p>We begin where the noise ends. The first discipline is to create the quiet in which a thought can survive.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Practice</p>
            <p>Ideas are cheap; practice is the only currency that compounds. We favour the unglamorous repetition over the brilliant intention.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Time</p>
            <p>The day is the unit of a life well lived. We design the morning, protect the deep hours, and let the evening fall quietly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Failure</p>
            <p>The fall is data. We do not romanticise struggle, but we refuse to waste it — every setback is a map of the next attempt.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Strength</p>
            <p>The body votes first. We train, eat and recover deliberately — because a strong mind needs a capable vessel.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Journey</p>
            <p>Go where you are a beginner again. New roads, new kitchens and new horizons keep the ego honest and the mind hungry.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word">On Joy</p>
            <p>Rest is a skill, not a reward. We choose our stories and our entertainment the way we choose training — to return stronger.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NewsletterSection />
</Layout>